      "message": "test(sim): pin the carried corner sliver of an outside contour as true rest\n\nThe 50 x 50 part in 60 x 60 stock, contoured with EM-0600-4FL (a 6 mm\nend mill, not 0.6 in), leaves full-height slivers at the stock corners\nbecause the round-cornered offset sweeps only 6 mm from each part corner\nand the stock corner is 7.07 mm away. The carried body matches that\ngeometry column by column; with an 8 mm tool it keeps no corner material.\nNo sim or carry change.\n\nFixes #1551\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
